---
import Button from '@/components/common/Button.astro';
import { SITE } from '@/utils/constants';
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-24 md:py-36">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="mb-4 text-sm font-medium tracking-wide text-primary-medium dark:text-primary-light">
        해양·기상 데이터 전문기업
      </p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl leading-tight font-bold text-gray-900 md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl dark:text-white">
        해양·기상 데이터를<br />
        <span class="text-primary dark:text-primary-light">연결하는 기술</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
        더 정확한 예측과 더 안전한 의사결정을 만듭니다.<br class="hidden md:block" />
        관측장비, 데이터 수집, 수치모델, GIS 시각화, 관제시스템까지 통합 제공합니다.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <Button href={`${ SITE.base }/services`} size="lg">서비스 보기</Button>
        <Button href={`${ SITE.base }/contact`} variant="outline" size="lg">문의하기</Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Background decoration -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 -z-10 size-96 rounded-full bg-primary-light/10 blur-3xl"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-1/2 -z-10 size-64 rounded-full bg-primary-medium/10 blur-3xl"></div>
</section>
